{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55007","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 三十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"或昼夜，大将剑刀鸣。\n刺客奸人在庭（京本作「应在」）近，急须搜捉莫教停，不信（辛本、川本作「便见」）血光成（京本作「成坑」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}